# Scheduling / optimization
#
# Goals:
#   - Exploit parallelism over the spatial dimension i using OpenMP.
#   - Improve instruction-level parallelism and make auto-vectorization easier
#     by tiling and partially unrolling inner loops.
#   - Preserve exact mathematical semantics: only loop restructurings that are
